You are a senior code reviewer. Please review the following code and provide feedback on potential issues, code quality, and security concerns:

```javascript
function calculateTotal(items) {
  let total = 0;
  for (let i = 0; i < items.length; i++) {
    const item = items[i];
    if (item.price) {
      total += item.price * (item.quantity || 1);
    }
  }
  return total;
}
```
